# Booking_ukr — контекст проекта

## Продукт

- **Пакет:** `grand-booking-ukr` (`package.json`)
- **Назначение:** система бронирования отеля (Grand), SPA
- **Режим:** `ssr: false`, `nitro.static`/prerender

## Стек

| Слой      | Технология                                              |
| --------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |
| Framework | Nuxt 4.4, Vue 3.5, TypeScript strict                    |
| Состояние | Pinia (`booking`, `auth`)                               |
| UI        | `@nuxt/ui`, `@headlessui/vue`                           |
| Стили     | SCSS, CSS Modules (`$style`), токены `--ds-*` / `--a-*` |
| API       | composable `useApi` → `NUXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE`            |
| Пакеты    | yarn                                                    |
| Тесты     | Vitest (`yarn test`)                                    |
| Storybook | `yarn storybook`                                        |

## Структура

```
app/
  pages/          # index, booking-details, confirmation, personal,
                  # cabinet, cancellation, multi-rooms, services
  components/
    booking/      # Card, Booking, TariffsList, BookingSummary, …
    cabinet/      # CabinetBookings, CabinetBookingCard
    core/         # DatePicker, GuestsSelector, RoomBlock, Breadcrumbs, …
    common/       # Banner, RequestErrorMessage
    layout/       # header, aside, footer, InitialLoadOverlay
    ui/           # Button, Input, Select, Tabs, Slider, …
    main/         # PlacementSection, AdvantageSection, EventsSection, …
  composables/    # useApi, useBooking*, useFormValidation, useUserProfile, …
  stores/         # booking.ts, auth.ts
  assets/styles/  # variables (_colors, _spacing, _rounding), tools
shared/types, shared/utils
server/routes/    # Nitro handlers
```

## Команды

```bash
yarn dev          # http://localhost:3000
yarn build
yarn lint
yarn lint:fix
yarn test         # Vitest
yarn storybook
```

